      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 503.46601953125,
        "r": 265.743,
        "b": 495.3783344167462
      },
      "content": "Check that the following requirements have been met:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1161",
      "reading_order": 1459,
      "section": "Requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.00000000000003,
        "t": 488.46301953125004,
        "r": 518.8103999999996,
        "b": 467.1723344167462
      },
      "content": " The appliance has been disconnected from the power supply and protective measures have been taken to ensure the power cannot be  switched on again."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1162",
      "reading_order": 1460,
      "section": "Requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.00000000000003,
        "t": 462.54301953125,
        "r": 163.61100000000002,
        "b": 454.0953344167462
      },
      "content": " The appliance is cool."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1163",
      "reading_order": 1461,
      "section": "Requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.991000000000014,
        "t": 450.06001953125,
        "r": 241.86600000000004,
        "b": 441.6123344167462
      },
      "content": " Anti-static precautions have been taken."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1164",
      "reading_order": 1462,
      "section": "Requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.00900000000004,
        "t": 437.34301953125004,
        "r": 406.02600000000007,
        "b": 428.8953344167462
      },
      "content": " The top, left and right panels of the casing of the appliance have been  removed."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1165",
      "reading_order": 1463,
      "section": "Requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.00900000000007,
        "t": 424.26601953125004,
        "r": 364.014,
        "b": 415.8183344167462
      },
      "content": " The high voltage capacitors are discharged before commencing work."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1166",
      "reading_order": 1464,
      "section": "Requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.0,
        "t": 393.06601953125,
        "r": 409.61699999999996,
        "b": 372.13533441674616
      },
      "content": "Unfasten the single M5.5 hex head flange bolt fixing the front panel to the cavity frame. Looking from the front, top right above the IO Board."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1167",
      "reading_order": 1465,
      "section": "Requirements",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.99999999999994,
        "t": 367.26301953125,
        "r": 362.0789999999998,
        "b": 359.1753344167462
      },
      "content": "Lift the front panel upwards and out to detach from the cavity frame."
    },
